  "texts": [
    {
      "spokenText": "Allez, Walter, c'est moi qui me chargerai de demander l'addition.",
      "textSHA256": "400ac7ab7ed63fe5584a872330cbe4a6fe736f7ad912b52320f91349f3d1a9dd",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 23
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Courage, les filles, on y est presque ! Les croquettes arrivent.",
      "textSHA256": "e46c7a9a331292aa6b494327a56b05e0023828fd4e05f135104fadfa9b417235",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 17
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "En attendant, nous regarderons comment ils servent le cidre de haut.",
      "textSHA256": "8ba77d740c01376029d98a6faec355cd6c06620d91f97b57a45a0f0df0b429f3",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 21
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Il est 21 h 10 un samedi, et la sidrería El Puerto, à Gijón, est pleine à craquer.",
      "textSHA256": "82e3aa7e5bea59ce56ceebdc59c7116e48b5f8f48fc00d6bce0742b3cc17a1ae",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Il y a un moment, ils ont commandé un cachopo à partager et une fabada pour Walter.",
      "textSHA256": "9d61392af1d47e88aa0517a4a8096732491732757d9ea5fe5712cc4314f1ea3a",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 3
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Je vous promets que le cachopo en vaudra la peine.",
      "textSHA256": "8f32e0e93402863f6411be7de48de431c6380c6c73a36e10023b9b31eca404ce",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 20
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Laura : Allez, Walter, c'est moi qui me chargerai de demander l'addition.",
      "textSHA256": "0b0da481ea228b6f3c9d9c3324679ced7386e50ee33765958b4e03b9f42ceb22",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 18
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Laura : En attendant, nous regarderons comment ils servent le cidre de haut.",
      "textSHA256": "14d3ffa785fff76d6337c77b516742b34dba3c30bf4b42e47a5f00ebde1c8aa0",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 11
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Laura : Je commanderai aussi une planche de charcuterie à grignoter tout de suite.",
      "textSHA256": "3ff0c371a0cb04e17821dc8fddfbadfa29651657802032159dbdf65173a6f48e",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 8
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Laura : Nel, tu nous apportes des croquettes en attendant, s'il te plaît ?",
      "textSHA256": "ae1202e3cd944afc7daefa978cd27a443442f5a0795428123286f86374ecc3a2",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 7
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Laura : Nel, tu nous préviens si la cuisine met plus de 50 minutes ?",
      "textSHA256": "e5c21dd1f8b46181f9bf4b468f3bf353528989384d0dc729e121acdbb119ebfc",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 15
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Laura : Si à 22 h il n'y a pas de cachopo, nous commanderons autre chose.",
      "textSHA256": "98cca99c541391a044bd1e5937237a3225d7460a2cfbc0cf84844c84e19d505c",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 16
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Laura encourage les filles : Courage, on y est presque !",
      "textSHA256": "c84fe85392d75db239c97fb0a13c96585a909562d4b52ed3dd6202276cee679c",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 10
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Laura est venue dîner avec son beau-père, Walter, et ses deux nièces, Inés et Carla.",
      "textSHA256": "5a0007bf3bc7f52a62c4a331c092777adb2a6c30c529a3e197e3c1ec61c9fa83",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Laura et Walter boivent leur culín d'un trait, Inés et Carla trinquent avec du jus de pomme, et tout le monde sourit.",
      "textSHA256": "267f27cc6f3739127450397045854d6b06f5da00531106fe71859b1675f0a30d",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 13
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Nel : Votre bon de commande est déjà en cuisine, mais ce soir, nous sommes très lents.",
      "textSHA256": "799247580172c43d0349ebe485f4afb8a670db1fd324f9fa80ae596863e59612",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 5
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Nel : « Votre commande est déjà en cuisine, mais ce soir, nous sommes très lents. »",
      "textSHA256": "afd92fc8f27c0e083f60d8c7e72f0da18febbf2f434bb2d5e9ec40ffc3a6ee2f",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "speaking-opening"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Nel accepte cette limite de temps et promet qu'à 22 h il passera à la table leur donner des nouvelles.",
      "textSHA256": "d19ea9258a9f1b9105c42c985d71c2f5aff03be1bab802e9ae49f480907935aa",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 17
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Nel recommande le fromage bleu de Cabrales, mais Inés dit que le fromage bleu est trop fort pour elle.",
      "textSHA256": "744429f4fd40061802921bf8d17998575cce7e2b02c77243796f57f57d5832df",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 9
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Nel sert le cidre naturel avec un long escanciado, en levant la bouteille au-dessus de sa tête.",
      "textSHA256": "9532f87d544a7226a2d344cede442ddc148edcfbb2461e86519d15b6ecdf7d04",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 12
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Nel, le serveur, s'approche et explique que la cuisine accuse 50 minutes de retard.",
      "textSHA256": "89abd128bce2cb0286d8b12b86b0aeb7ea97e10d350859b02e45e80989f35ad9",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 4
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Nel, tu nous apportes des croquettes en attendant, s'il te plaît ?",
      "textSHA256": "e3036396415ad3a4a2bb911d36eb5765f99664128586560be45514b78387f6b5",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 16
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Nel, tu nous préviens si la cuisine met plus de 50 minutes ?",
      "textSHA256": "bb85b612560b022d7e3564e60701e2140e949e5c3a29444e56bf145166be1dfb",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 22
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Quand le picoteo arrive, Inés et Carla reprennent aussitôt le moral.",
      "textSHA256": "1c90e71ef654b47977a1fbcef32fb6a5819b93931eb12ccf4ae8715e459f470b",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 14
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Si à 22 h il n'y a pas de cachopo, nous commanderons autre chose.",
      "textSHA256": "a7d4c3b3df249ebd2c36b2b164bdef26325cebd01712da71bec6e929ffd0464d",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 19
        },
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "speaking-closure"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Walter est fatigué et demande s'il ne vaudrait pas mieux chercher un autre endroit.",
      "textSHA256": "95d0526d2039cb535b5f080d4f6955d76cc8d3e244091606080647e3ca0130ff",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "reader",
          "index": 6
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "Walter, dans 20 minutes, nous déciderons si nous restons.",
      "textSHA256": "0962aba010b98f5ccd71c524c9be3297b7e3ef70b6f9d9f93b22ebf2df78f452",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 18
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "spokenText": "l'escanciado (cidre versé de haut pour l'aérer)",
      "textSHA256": "b43c5420323a2b29f5850ba853089feb89db67904a70390f7e48aa047f16dfb3",
      "placements": [
        {
          "lessonId": "master-travel-dinner:11:fr-en",
          "surface": "card",
          "index": 3
